                                                "sense_id": "9688c0a1-6de1-3bd5-90e2-adb681cf7e59",
                                                "text": "Heny Hankovitch, con guítar, / did a short Zen pray, / on his tatami in a relaxed lotos / fixin his mind on nuffin, rose-blue breasts,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19ba2418-23fd-4f52-a73e-85e56bd17bee",
                                                "sense_id": "9688c0a1-6de1-3bd5-90e2-adb681cf7e59",
                                                "text": "Small tools are spread on the tatami: a razor knife, a sprue cutter, curls of emery paper."
                                            }
